WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
It has to work in ordinary life.

00:02.500 --> 00:07.200
A parent saving a drawing should choose
where it lives and who can see it.

00:08.100 --> 00:13.000
That's what I'm building: useful tools
that give families more choice.

00:13.900 --> 00:17.600
This page is the history behind that work.
